-- 1167: Blog post - "Shooting the Moon on a Smartphone: Five Lessons from Our 28 December 2025 Mobile Photography Class"
--
--       Case-study post for CASL - Master Mobile Photography (TGS-2026064718),
--       from the 28 December 2025 class run taught by Tan Chin Hock. Five class
--       photographs (travelator leading lines, moon exposure, telephoto craters,
--       moonrise over treeline, HDB sunset) uploaded to R2 under
--       blog/photography/2025-12-28-* (all verified HTTP 200).
--       Ships already published (status 1) and BACK-DATED to the class date
--       2025-12-28; linkedin_urn carries the manual-skip sentinel so
--       publishDue / the share cron never post it to LinkedIn (per the
--       blog-pipeline rule: back-dated posts are never auto-shared).
--
-- Every course figure below was read off the LIVE course page on 2026-08-29:
--   * Fee card: full $720.00 before GST, $784.80 GST-inclusive, GST $64.80 (9%),
--     baseline nett $424.80 (SG/PR 21+, 50%), MCES/SME nett $280.80 (SG 40+, 70%).
--   * Course information: 2 days / 16 hrs, Beginner, 2 hr assessment.
--   * Venue: 12 Woodlands Square, Woods Square Tower 1, Singapore 737715.
--   * Funding validity 19 Aug 2026 - 18 Aug 2027 (post-dates the class date, so
--     the body deliberately says "check the course page" instead of printing
--     dates that would be anachronistic in a Dec-2025-dated post).
--   * Badges: CASL, SFC, PSEA, UTAP, SFEC, Absentee Payroll, MCES.
--
-- Notes for future editors:
--  * apply.php splits statements on ";" at end-of-line - the content HTML is ONE line.
